OL,3,ASpeedboat killer jailed for attack on
OL,4,Agirlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeedboat killer Jack Shepherd has been
OL,7,Fjailed for 20 months with a further
OL,8,Ffour years on extended licence for
OL,9,Fviolently assaulting his girlfriend,
OL,10,Fincluding hitting her chest with a set
OL,11,Fof hot barbecue tongs.
OL,13,FThe 38-year-old had pleaded guilty to
OL,14,Ftwo counts of assault occasioning
OL,15,Factual bodily harm and damaging
OL,16,Fproperty at Isleworth Crown Court in
OL,17,FJuly.
OL,19,FThe attacks happened in February and
OL,20,FJune last year and sparked Shepherd's
OL,21,Frecall to prison.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
