OL,3,ASpeedboat killer jailed for attack on
OL,4,Agirlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was originally jailed in 2018 for
OL,7,Fsix years and six months for
OL,8,Fmanslaughter over the death of
OL,9,F24-year-old Charlotte Brown when his
OL,10,Fspeedboat crashed during a first date.
